WEBVTT

00:00:24.541 --> 00:00:25.541
[Judy screaming]

00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:28.041
[both panting]

00:00:28.125 --> 00:00:29.958
[water spouting]

00:00:33.541 --> 00:00:34.583
Are you okay?

00:00:34.666 --> 00:00:36.500
Yeah. Yes.

00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:38.291
Uh, you?

00:00:38.375 --> 00:00:40.500
I... Well, I've...

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:42.708
[stutters] I feel like some...

00:00:42.791 --> 00:00:45.416
some "sorries," uh,
may be in order.

00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:47.916
Nick, it's okay.

00:00:48.666 --> 00:00:51.291
I know you didn't want to
lose him on purpose.

00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:55.125
Oh, not me sorry. No, no.

00:00:55.208 --> 00:00:56.333
You sorry.

00:00:57.458 --> 00:01:00.791
Well, now we kinda have
no way to find him

00:01:00.875 --> 00:01:02.041
or stop the lynxes,

00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:04.000
so agree to disagree.

00:01:05.166 --> 00:01:06.291
But...

00:01:06.375 --> 00:01:07.791
we are alive.

00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:10.291
So if we can't find him,
that's great.

00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:13.208
What we can find
is a truck out of here.

00:01:13.291 --> 00:01:14.333
Gah.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:30.166
Box of old matches. Helpful.

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:34.166
Trudy Cabbagepatch,
leaving town. We're done.

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:36.125
Yodelayheehoo!

00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:38.833
Ah, dis is veird place
for you to be.

00:01:38.916 --> 00:01:40.125
Ja
, very veird.

00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:41.916
Ach, zey fell out of ze tube.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.833
Okay, ve vill call police
to help!

00:01:43.916 --> 00:01:45.458
Nope! No, no, we're fine.

00:01:45.541 --> 00:01:47.625
Yep, we were
just leaving town.

00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:50.875
Actually, um,
do you happen to know

00:01:50.958 --> 00:01:52.875
where this tube goes?

00:01:52.958 --> 00:01:54.583
-Oh, Copenhoofen.
-[Jürgen]
Ja, ist Copenhoofen.

00:01:54.666 --> 00:01:56.041
-Got it. Thank y--
-[Jürgen coughing]

00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:59.375
Oh, you chew too much.
This is not okay!

00:01:59.458 --> 00:02:01.166
[Jürgen coughing]

00:02:03.291 --> 00:02:04.541
Huh.

00:02:04.625 --> 00:02:06.833
Where did... Where did
you find these flowers?

00:02:06.916 --> 00:02:08.125
Oh, the Liebenflower?

00:02:08.208 --> 00:02:09.750
Ze tippity-top of ze mountain.

00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:11.083
Uh, zis is ze only place
zey grow.

00:02:11.166 --> 00:02:12.458
Oh, boy.

00:02:12.541 --> 00:02:13.833
-Is...
-[hooves clacking]

00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:17.375
Uh, is there anything else
up there?

00:02:17.458 --> 00:02:19.208
-Nope, there sure isn't.
-[Berthold] Oh,
ja.

00:02:19.291 --> 00:02:20.625
Old Honeymoon Lodge.

00:02:20.708 --> 00:02:23.458
But is closed for long time.
Was hideout for snakes.

00:02:23.541 --> 00:02:24.541
[gasps]

00:02:25.708 --> 00:02:27.250
Honeymoon Lodge.

00:02:27.333 --> 00:02:28.666
-How...
-[hooves clacking]

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:29.791
How do you reach it?

00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:32.708
Oh, tourists take ze tram
from Copenhoofen,

00:02:32.791 --> 00:02:34.916
but ze rope is faster.

00:02:35.916 --> 00:02:38.791
[Jürgen] Good luck! Have fun
at ze Honeymoon Lodge!

00:02:38.875 --> 00:02:39.875
Thank you!

00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:44.916
[Judy grunts]

00:02:46.291 --> 00:02:47.916
[Judy] What does the secret

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.083
have to do with
the reptiles leaving town?

00:02:52.041 --> 00:02:54.041
How did it get hidden in the
journal in the first place?

00:02:54.125 --> 00:02:55.833
Will you slow down?

00:02:58.166 --> 00:02:59.375
How long do you think
it's going to be

00:02:59.458 --> 00:03:01.833
before Hoggbottom and the ZPD
figure out where we are?

00:03:01.916 --> 00:03:04.750
If anything,
we should be going faster.

00:03:05.958 --> 00:03:07.208
As I always say...

00:03:07.291 --> 00:03:10.500
[through carrot pen]
I really am just a dumb bunny.

00:03:10.583 --> 00:03:11.416
Nick...

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:12.375
[rewinding]

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:14.166
I-- I-- I-- I-- I really am

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:16.041
ju-- dumb-- dumb-- dumb--
dumb-- dumb-- dumb bunny.

00:03:16.125 --> 00:03:18.291
Just dumb-- dumb-- dumb--
dumb-- dumb-- dumb bunny.

00:03:18.375 --> 00:03:21.708
This was a gift
to symbolize our partnership,

00:03:21.791 --> 00:03:24.166
and it is not appropriate
for this moment.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:25.791
Oh, no, I was just...
[chuckles]

00:03:25.875 --> 00:03:27.500
...hoping to jot down
some ideas

00:03:27.583 --> 00:03:29.708
for what we will put
on our tombstones.

00:03:29.791 --> 00:03:32.583
I'll start.
"His partner did it."

00:03:32.666 --> 00:03:33.500
What happened to you

00:03:33.583 --> 00:03:35.291
that you can't just have
a normal conversation?

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.625
I will save that
for my therapy animal.

00:03:40.291 --> 00:03:41.333
Yeah,

00:03:41.416 --> 00:03:43.291
-you need a therapy animal.
-Oh, yeah.

00:03:43.375 --> 00:03:47.000
Well, you need
a herd of therapy animals.

00:03:47.083 --> 00:03:51.083
Yeah. You need a whole
migration of therapy animals.

00:03:53.125 --> 00:03:54.666
-[Judy gasps]
-[Nick strains]

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:55.791
[both gasping]

00:04:22.833 --> 00:04:23.833
[grunts]

00:04:24.666 --> 00:04:25.916
Carrots?

00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:28.416
[sighs]

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.250
[beeping]

00:04:38.541 --> 00:04:39.541
[snorts]

00:04:40.083 --> 00:04:41.208
-[snorts]
-[beeping continues]

00:04:42.291 --> 00:04:43.125
Hmm.

00:04:46.083 --> 00:04:47.250
[growls, snorts]

00:04:53.833 --> 00:04:55.541
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

00:04:58.250 --> 00:04:59.958
[creaking]

00:05:03.833 --> 00:05:06.208
[creaking]

00:05:08.458 --> 00:05:09.958
Hey, Carrots?

00:05:16.666 --> 00:05:17.666
[Judy] Huh.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.375
[squelches, splashes]

00:05:19.458 --> 00:05:20.625
Ew.

00:05:20.708 --> 00:05:22.125
[breathes shakily]

